==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Fusion Strike|Zorua|170}} from the {{TCG|Fusion Strike}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Zorua}}.
*'''Surprise Attack''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Gym Challenge|Brock's Diglett|67}} from the {{TCG|Gym Challenge}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

